<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings cuts Stad Rotterdam to hold.</title>
<headline>ING Barings cuts Stad Rotterdam to hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of April 11 research.</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Stad Rotterdam  insurance     82.60   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (buy). Stad Rotterdam 1996 net profit rose by 17.6 pct to 156.9 million guilders. Thursday's 1996 profit figures were of good quality, since exceptional charges of 32 million guilders were taken (for euro and other purposes). Stad Rotterdam said it was targeting an average net profit growth of at least 8 percent annually for the coming years. We have raised our EPS estimates, but we change our recommendation for the stock from buy to hold for valuation reasons.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS     pvs EPS   P/E</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)     4.99		  n.a.</p>
<p>    1997		  5.34    (5.19)    15.5</p>
<p>    1998		  5.74    (5.58)    14.4</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
